    "熊护卫开始吟唱咒语，接下来的战斗中他的两种防御都会提升。"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_battle_loop2_3c1fc3e8:

    # "You are afraid you can't drag the battle any longer, you have to defeat him more quickly."
    "你担心再拖下去也撑不住了，必须更快击败他。"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_battle_loop2_488d5b9a:

    # bearGuard "We are stronger than you think, you won't be defeating me with your weak attacks!"
    bearGuard "我们比你想象中更强；就凭你这点软弱的攻击，休想击败我！"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_win_a01f30ef:

    # "You manage to defeat the bear guard, as you see the bear fall into the thick snow."
    "你成功击败了熊护卫，看着他倒进厚厚的积雪中。"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_win_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_win_a22d26ca:

    # "You retreat from the bear, signaling that you're not attacking him anymore."
    "你从熊护卫身边退开，示意自己不再攻击他。"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_win_844e957f:

    # "He lets out a heavy sigh and shivers, the bear is probably not in the mood for anything else."
    "他长长地叹了口气，打了个寒颤；看来熊已经没心情做别的了。"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_win_6dbcc06a:

    # "As you search around the bear guard, you found a piece of Bear Fur and a Bear Tribe Harpoon!"
    "你在熊护卫身边搜寻，找到一块熊皮和一把熊族鱼叉！"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_win_5b805c14:

    # "As you search around the bear guard, you found a piece of Bear Fur!"
    "你在熊护卫身边搜寻，找到一块熊皮！"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_win_b7267e82:

    # "After a few moments, you leave the bear guard behind and continue your journey."
    "片刻后，你把熊护卫留在身后，继续踏上旅程。"

translate schinese_rewrite bearguard_lose_e7c2e0d0:

    # "The bear guard roars, his voice echoing through the forest as you fall to the ground."
    "熊护卫咆哮，声音在森林中回荡；你倒在了地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_1c476f80:

    # "The acolyte raises the pendant in his hand, his manhood proudly hanging in the damp air."
    "邪教侍从举起手中的吊坠；他的阳物骄傲地垂在潮湿的空气中。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_911915d8:

    # "The cultist casts a ring of gloom towards your direction, dealing [enemy_damage] HP."
    "邪教侍从朝你施放一道幽暗光环，造成[enemy_damage]点伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_d712f1c1:

    # acolyte "You will soon become one of us, it is your fate."
    acolyte "你很快就会成为我们的一员，这是你的命运。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_55c5028c:

    # acolyte "Let the darkness consume you, dragon."
    acolyte "让黑暗吞噬你吧，龙。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_62f32d5e:

    # acolyte "The Shepherd will guide you to the right path, you will see."
    acolyte "牧羊人会把你引向正确的道路，你会明白的。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_43d89f12:

    # "The cultist casts a ring of gloom towards your direction, but you manage to dodge it just in time."
    "邪教侍从朝你施放一道幽暗光环，但你及时躲开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_3693227c:

    # acolyte "Run all you want, you won't escape his call."
    acolyte "尽管逃吧，你逃不出他的召唤。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_2d918f66:

    # "The cult acolyte raises his pendant, and you can see the tip of the pendant is glowing."
    "邪教侍从举起吊坠，你看到顶端发出光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_7de14ed3:

    # "He swings the pendant around, exuding a strange aura that makes you feel a little bit of heat."
    "他挥动吊坠，散发出奇异的气场，让你感到一丝热意。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_bf78bd35:

    # acolyte "Join us willingly, and you will be exalted."
    acolyte "自愿加入我们吧，你将得到升华。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_a532fac0:

    # acolyte "Your destiny is intertwined with ours. Accept it."
    acolyte "你的命运与我们的命运交织在一起。接受它吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_e688b522:

    # acolyte "We know who you are, dragon. Resistance only delays the inevitable."
    acolyte "我们知道你是谁，龙。抵抗只会拖延不可避免的结局。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_5ec46176:

    # "You feel a little bit of heat from the acolyte's charm, and his exposed manhood."
    "邪教侍从的魅惑与裸露的阳物让你感到一丝热意。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_45a9fad8:

    # "Your lust increased by [enemy_flirt]."
    "你的欲望增加了[enemy_flirt]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_85369e5f:

    # "You are now much more confused, you have a feeling you might be hypnotised if this continues..."
    "你现在更加困惑了。你有种感觉，如果这样继续下去，你可能会被催眠……"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_3b11328a:

    # "You are now much more confused, perhaps attacking him successfully can interrupt his psychic attack."
    "你现在更加困惑了；也许成功攻击他，就能打断他的精神攻击。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_1fa22dfd:

    # "You are now confused, your attack has a chance to hit yourself instead."
    "你现在陷入了困惑，你的攻击有可能反过来击中自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_15354222:

    # "You turn your head away from the acolyte's charm, dodging his attempt at your mind."
    "你扭头避开邪教侍从的魅惑，躲过了他对你心智的攻击。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_99a4ba86:

    # "While you are calculating your next move, you fall into his trap, your dodges are now reduced by half for 3 rounds."
    "你盘算下一步时落入了他的陷阱，接下来3回合你的闪避降低一半。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_27d89049:

    # acolyte "You have fallen for our oldest trick, dragon. I am afraid there is no way out now."
    acolyte "你中了我们最古老的把戏，龙。恐怕现在已经无路可逃了。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_ab21dec8:

