    "邪教侍从呼唤牧羊人，你感觉脚下的地面开始震动。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_d3a2d2ad:

    # "Suddenly, a dark tendril emerges from the ground, wrapping around your leg."
    "突然，一根黑暗的触须从地面钻出，缠住你的腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_197e21e5:

    # "It seems you are now bound."
    "看来你现在被束缚了。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_523e5816:

    # acolyte "Let him guide you to your true destiny."
    acolyte "让他引导你走向真正的命运。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_26e062a9:

    # "Chanting in an ancient tongue, he calls upon Tapjoo's wrath, unleashing a torrent of divine energy that sweeps across the chamber."
    "他用古老的语言吟唱，呼唤塔普久的怒火，释放出横扫整个房间的神圣能量洪流。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_f59c8605:

    # "The aftershock drains your mana. You lose [enemy_mp_damage] MP and [enemy_damage] HP."
    "余波抽干了你的魔力。你失去[enemy_mp_damage]点魔力和[enemy_damage]点生命值。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_ffb81d6d:

    # acolyte "We will cleanse you of your sins, dragon. The shepherd will guide you to the light."
    acolyte "我们会净化你的罪孽，龙。牧羊人会引导你走向光明。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_5c8afe60:

    # "You manage to dodge the attack, but the divine energy still manages to drain [enemy_mp_damage] MP."
    "你成功躲开攻击，但神圣能量仍抽走了[enemy_mp_damage]点魔力。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_battle_loop_34518a0f:

    # acolyte "Your willpower intrigues me, but it cannot withstand the shepherd's might."
    acolyte "你的意志力令我感兴趣，但它承受不住牧羊人的力量。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_win_f6a071f0:

    # "The cult acolyte falls to the ground, his pendant shattering into pieces."
    "邪教侍从倒在地上，吊坠碎成了片。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_win_e58152f6:

    # acolyte "No... this is not going as planned."
    acolyte "不……这和计划的不一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_win_52ad5004:

    # "He turns to you, trying to run away as a bright white light suddenly explodes from the pendant."
    "他转身想逃，吊坠却突然爆发出耀眼的白光。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_win_46f6aab4:

    # "The light engulfs the acolyte, and soon yourself as your consciousness fades."
    "光芒吞没了邪教侍从，也很快吞没了你；你的意识逐渐消散。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_win_5f2c313e:

    # "Your body falls backwards, hitting something hard as you lose your grip on reality."
    "你失去对现实的掌控，身体向后倒去，撞上了某个坚硬的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_win_ae7bfda4:

    # "And then, darkness is all you can see."
    "接着，你眼前只剩黑暗。"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_win_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite cultacolyte_lose_fbbb586e:

    # "As you fall on the ground, you can hear the two werewolves howling at each other."
    "你倒在地上，听见两只狼人互相嚎叫。"

