    # "The werewolves are lying on the floor, still panting..."
    "两只狼人躺在地上，还在喘息……"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_werewolf_win_1854eb56:

    # "As you search around the werewolves, you found 2 Iron ores, 2 Pelts and [exp_drop] EXP!"
    "你在狼人身边搜寻，找到2块铁矿石、2张兽皮和[exp_drop]点经验！"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_werewolf_win_3909bbba:

    # "As you search around the werewolves, you found 2 Pelt and [exp_drop] EXP!"
    "你在狼人身边搜寻，找到2张兽皮和[exp_drop]点经验！"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_werewolf_win_d13a5aec:

    # "You also found a pair of trousers... from a Hunter."
    "你还找到了一条猎人的裤子。"

translate schinese_rewrite werewolf_werewolf_win_d31bae78:

    # "You also found an old copper pickaxe."
    "你还找到了一把旧铜镐。"

