    # "You raise your fists. The Seedsman holds out his hands, and from his open palm a hail of razor-thin thorns spirals against you."
    "你举起双拳。种子人伸出双手，开放的掌心中旋出一阵剃刀般锋利的荆棘，朝你袭来。"

