    "你抽出[pc.weapon.name!t]。种子人抬起一条手臂，开放的掌心中旋出一阵剃刀般锋利的荆棘，朝你袭来。"

translate schinese_rewrite seedsman_battle_loop_f44f48e3:

    # "The seedsman throws a seed bomb towards your direction, dealing [enemy_damage] HP."
