translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_fe3c8f00:

    # "The slushy skids across the ice and hammers into Daggi's side, coating his furs in freezing sludge. [ally.name]'s health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "冰泥怪在冰面上滑行，重重撞上达吉的侧腹，冻泥溅满他的毛皮。[ally.name]的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_8f6c35cd:

    # "The slushy shoots across the ice toward you, but you twist clear before it can bowl you over."
    "冰泥怪在冰面上朝你疾冲而来，但你扭身避开，没让它把你撞翻。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_35fd27e6:

    # "The slushy rushes Daggi, but he pivots on the ice and lets it rush past his guard."
    "冰泥怪冲向达吉，但他在冰面上转身，让它从防守旁冲了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_71312f71:

    # "A spray of sleet bursts into your chest and face. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "一阵霰雪喷向你的胸口和脸。你的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_f5d55e1b:

    # "The cold bites deep, and frost starts clinging to your limbs."
    "寒意刺入骨髓，霜冻开始附着在你的四肢上。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_4431c531:

    # "The slushy lashes Daggi with a burst of jagged ice, forcing him back a step. [ally.name]'s health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "冰泥怪向达吉甩出一阵参差的冰刃，将他逼退一步。[ally.name]的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_7b0f017c:

    # "The slushy bursts outward in a fan of sleet, but you shield yourself from the freezing spray."
    "冰泥怪向外迸散成扇形霰雪，但你护住身体，挡开了冰冷的飞溅。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_487ac052:

    # "Daggi catches the sleet on the shaft of his harpoon and shakes the ice free before it can slow him down."
    "达吉用鱼叉的矛杆接住霰雪，在冰块拖慢他之前将其抖落。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_475b243f:

    # "The slushy floods around your boots and flash-freezes into a heavy collar of ice."
    "冰泥怪漫过你的靴子，瞬间冻结成一圈沉重的冰环。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_7d51f0f4:

    # d "Break that before it pins you."
    d "在它把你困死前打碎它。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_000b973c:

    # "You are trapped in the slush and your footing becomes much harder to recover."
    "你被困在泥冰中，脚下变得难以站稳。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_6f7f4f4f:

    # "The slushy drags scattered frost and cave ice back into itself, swelling into a thicker, colder body."
    "冰泥怪将散落的霜雪和洞窟冰层拖回体内，膨胀成更厚、更冷的身躯。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_e521edb6:

    # "Its icy shell knits shut as it restores [healing_amount] HP."
    "它的冰壳重新拼合，恢复了[healing_amount]点生命值。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_edf11096:

    # "The slushy spreads thin across the ice, then compresses into a denser frozen slab that is harder to pierce."
    "冰泥怪在冰面上摊薄身躯，随后压缩成更致密的冰板，变得更难刺穿。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_turn_78913af6:

    # d "It's hardening. Hit the cracks."
    d "它在硬化。瞄准裂缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_win_76de0f8a:

    # "You drive your fist into the slushy's chilled core while Daggi tears its outer shell apart with a final wrench of his harpoon."
    "你一拳捣入冰泥怪冰冷的核心；达吉用鱼叉最后一记扭绞撕开它的外壳。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_win_4d1f0d95:

    # "You tear your [pc.weapon.name!t] through the slushy's chilled core as Daggi hooks the creature open with his harpoon, ripping the frozen mass apart."
    "你用[pc.weapon.name!t]撕开冰泥怪冰冷的核心，达吉则用鱼叉勾住怪物，将这团冻泥撕裂开来。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_win_86f0d2f7:

    # d "There. Don't let it pool back together."
    d "就是那里。别让它重新聚拢。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_win_f590e3de:

    # "You drive your fist into the slushy's chilled core until the whole mass shudders apart."
    "你一拳接一拳砸入冰泥怪冰冷的核心，直到整个躯体颤抖着崩散。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_win_f2dadb98:

    # "You tear your [pc.weapon.name!t] free from the slushy's chilled core, and the whole thing collapses in on itself."
    "你将[pc.weapon.name!t]从冰泥怪冰冷的核心中抽出，整个怪物随即向内坍塌。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_win_dac054a9:

    # "The pale sludge splashes across the cave floor, freezes into brittle sheets, and then cracks apart into slush and icy fragments."
    "苍白的泥浆溅满洞窟地面，冻结成易碎的薄片，随后碎裂成泥冰和冰屑。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_win_3d64f053:

    # "As you search through the frozen sludge, you find a [slimeball_item.name], a [slimecrystal_item.name] and [exp_drop] EXP!"
    "你在冻泥中搜寻，找到[slimeball_item.name]、[slimecrystal_item.name]，并获得[exp_drop]点经验！"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_win_e1799bc9:

    # "As you search through the frozen sludge, you find a [slimeball_item.name] and [exp_drop] EXP!"
    "你在冻泥中搜寻，找到[slimeball_item.name]，并获得[exp_drop]点经验！"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_a95062db:

    # "The slushy floods across the ice and smashes into you with crushing frozen weight before Daggi can peel it off."
    "冰泥怪在冰面上泛滥而过，带着碾碎一切的冻重猛撞向你，达吉来不及将它从你身上剥开。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_0ec9c914:

    # "You hit the cave floor hard, the cold seeping into your bones as the slushy engulfs you in a suffocating embrace of ice and sludge."
    "你重重撞上洞窟地面，寒意渗入骨头；冰泥怪将你吞没在令人窒息的冰泥拥抱中。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_2fbdfe74:

    # d "[e]? Get up!"
    d "[e]？快起来！"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_458e3838:

    # "You try to respond, but none of your muscles seem to obey you as your body is entirely encased in the slushy."
    "你试图回应，但身体完全被冰泥怪包裹，肌肉似乎全都不听使唤。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_a583108c:

    # "It doesn't take long before your vision fade..."
    "没过多久，你的视野便开始模糊……"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_d673420f:

    # "Your boots lock in place as the slushy surges over your legs and hardens around them."
    "你的靴子被冻在原地，冰泥怪漫过双腿，在周围凝结。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_71177e95:

    # "Before you can wrench yourself free, the creature slams into your chest and sends you crashing onto the frozen stone."
    "你还没来得及挣脱，怪物便撞上你的胸口，将你狠狠撞到冰冷的石地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_9bdb8b76:

    # "The last thing you feel is the wet, killing cold creeping through your clothes while the cave spins above you."
    "你最后感受到的是湿冷而致命的寒意透过衣物，而洞窟在你头顶旋转。"

translate schinese_rewrite slushy_lose_7be540ac:

    # "When you finally wake, you are sprawled near the cave mouth, shivering and soaked with half-frozen sludge."
    "你终于醒来时，正浑身湿透、瑟瑟发抖地躺在洞窟入口附近，身上沾满半冻的泥浆。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_11d64d80:

    # "The two bronze bear warrior statues wrench free together. You raise your fists as Herd snatches up a broken stone rod and plants himself at your side."
    "两座青铜熊战士雕像一同挣脱束缚。赫德抓起一根断裂的石棍，站到你身旁；你也握紧双拳。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_48275959:

    # "The two bronze bear warrior statues wrench free together. You ready your [pc.weapon.name!t] as Herd snatches up a broken stone rod and plants himself at your side."
    "两座青铜熊战士雕像一同挣脱束缚。赫德抓起一根断裂的石棍，站到你身旁；你准备好[pc.weapon.name!t]。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_3b15d0cc:

    # "Herd flashes a sharp hand signal toward the left statue, then the right, already tracking how they move."
    "赫德朝左边的雕像、再朝右边打出利落的手势，已经开始判断它们的行动方式。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_daggi_battle_3fe46c51:

    # "The two bronze bear warrior statues wrench free from their pedestals as Daggi braces beside you with his harpoon leveled."
    "两座青铜熊战士雕像挣脱底座，达吉在你身旁架起鱼叉，准备迎敌。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_daggi_battle_06e0951a:

    # "You clench your fists and meet the charge with him."
    "你攥紧双拳，与达吉一同迎击冲锋。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_daggi_battle_5ae07d7a:

    # "You raise your [pc.weapon.name!t] and meet the charge with him."
    "你举起[pc.weapon.name!t]，与达吉一同迎击冲锋。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_2cb72799:

    # "It's your turn now."
    "轮到你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_0d3408ce:

    # "It's [ally.name]'s turn now."
    "现在轮到[ally.name]行动。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_9bb12b60:

    # "Daggi steps in with a quick thrust, but [target.name] turns the blow aside with a grind of stone."
    "达吉挺矛迅刺，但[target.name]伴随石块摩擦的刺响，将这一击拨开。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_97988f5f:

    # "Herd darts in with the broken rod, but [target.name] catches the angle and the strike skids off its carved shell."
    "赫德挥断棍冲上前，但[target.name]判断出角度，攻击从雕刻的外壳上滑开。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_1a09823d:

    # "Daggi snaps his harpoon into [target.name]'s midsection, dealing [oa[4]] HP and shaving a strip of stone from its frame."
    "达吉将鱼叉猛地刺入[target.name]的腹部，造成[oa[4]]点伤害，并从它的躯体上削下一道石痕。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_4b9fc1a7:

    # "Herd lashes out with the broken rod and cracks it across [target.name]'s arm, dealing [oa[4]] HP."
    "赫德挥动断棍，狠狠砸过[target.name]的手臂，造成[oa[4]]点伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_e2085c70:

    # "You try to get a rise out of the carved guardians, but the statues answer with nothing but grinding stone."
    "你试图激怒雕刻的守护者，但雕像只以石块摩擦的轰鸣回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_021b55d5:

    # d "There."
    d "就是那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_2ae2cf03:

    # "Daggi drives his harpoon into a seam in [target.name]'s chest, dealing [ally_damage] HP and knocking stone chips across the floor."
    "达吉将鱼叉刺入[target.name]胸口的接缝，造成[ally_damage]点伤害，石屑随之飞落满地。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_76154b52:

    # d "Low, maybe?"
    d "低一点？"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_3c704d2e:

    # "Daggi hooks low and tears [target.name] off balance, dealing [ally_damage] HP."
    "这一击震得[target.name]踉跄，造成[ally_damage]点伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_3adb3e7d:

    # "The blow staggers [target.name], freezing it in place for a moment."
    "这一击震得[target.name]踉跄，短暂地僵在原地。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_4a6e8fe4:

    # "Herd darts in under the sweeping shaft and slams his stone rod into the Glaive Statue's arm, dealing [ally_damage] HP."
    "赫德从横扫而过的长柄武器下冲入，将石棍狠狠砸向长戟石像的手臂，造成[ally_damage]点伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_3d3e529d:

    # "Herd slips around the shield rim and cracks the Bulwark across an exposed joint, dealing [ally_damage] HP."
    "赫德绕过盾牌边缘，猛击壁垒石像暴露的关节，造成[ally_damage]点伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_9006a6b9:

    # "The impact jars [target.name] and leaves it frozen in place for a moment."
    "这一击震得[target.name]僵在原地片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_b2873b41:

    # d "Stay close."
    d "跟紧我。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_f751c9f0:

    # "Daggi catches the next incoming strike on the shaft of his harpoon and turns it aside, raising your defence for this round."
    "达吉用鱼叉的矛杆接住下一击，将其拨开，使你本回合的防御力提高。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_329f3c62:

    # "Herd yanks a fallen slab upright and braces it between you and the statues, signaling for you to keep close to the cover."
    "赫德将倒下的石板拽起来，挡在你和雕像之间，示意你靠近掩体。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_3591ad6e:

    # "The shifted stone knocks the pressure off your footing and gives you room to move again."
    "挪动的石板减轻了脚下的压力，你又有了移动的空间。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_c054002b:

    # d "Let's open it up."
    d "把它打开。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_7d035640:

    # "Daggi slams the butt of his harpoon into an old fracture and widens it, dealing [oa[4]] HP to [target.name]."
    "达吉用鱼叉尾端砸进旧裂缝并将其扩大，造成[oa[4]]点伤害；[target.name]的外壳随之裂开。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_19db1ead:

    # "Stone dust spills from the wound as [target.name]'s shell weakens."
    "[target.name]的外壳逐渐变弱，石尘从伤口中簌簌落下。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_30679fb3:

    # "Herd hammers the Glaive Statue again and again at the same cracked seam, dealing [ally_damage] HP."
    "赫德一次又一次地锤击长戟石像同一处裂缝，造成[ally_damage]点伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_4c09024d:

    # "Herd batters the Bulwark's shield arm in a flurry of brutal strikes, dealing [ally_damage] HP."
    "赫德以一连串凶猛的打击猛攻壁垒石像的持盾手臂，造成[ally_damage]点伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_35cc4538:

    # "Chips of stone rain to the floor as [target.name]'s shell weakens."
    "[target.name]的外壳逐渐变弱，石片如雨般落到地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_5e121111:

    # "The two statues close off the only clear way through the chamber. There is nowhere to run."
    "两座雕像封住了穿过石室的唯一通道。无处可逃。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_1a8195ef:

    # "You falter, but Daggi's warning comes a breath too late as both statues bear down."
    "你脚下一软，但达吉的警告还是晚了一瞬；两座雕像已经压迫而来。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_c279de27:

    # d "Stay up!"
    d "站起来！"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_battle_loop_6ddcbbbb:

    # "You falter, and Herd's frantic warning gesture is swallowed by the roar of grinding stone."
    "你脚下一软，赫德焦急的手势被石块摩擦的轰鸣吞没。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_95820382:

    # "The Glaive Statue lunges in a brutal forward rush, its bronze spear point crashing into your guard. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "长戟石像以残酷的冲势扑来，青铜矛尖撞上你的防守。你的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_cda0c270:

    # "The Glaive Statue drives its spear into Daggi's side with a grinding thrust. [ally.name]'s health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "长戟石像将青铜长矛刺入达吉的侧腹。[ally.name]的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_a27388ae:

    # "The Glaive Statue spears toward Herd, clipping him hard across the ribs. [ally.name]'s health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "长戟石像朝赫德刺出长矛，狠狠擦过他的肋骨。[ally.name]的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_b8492856:

    # "The Glaive Statue launches at you, but you cut aside before the spear point can pin you."
    "长戟石像朝你扑来，但你在矛尖钉住你之前侧身避开。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_149bc0df:

    # "Daggi twists around the Glaive Statue's lunging spear and lets it carve empty air."
    "达吉绕过长戟石像刺来的长矛，让矛尖只刺入空处。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_ec7a6c85:

    # "Herd ducks under the spear thrust at the last possible instant."
    "赫德在最后一刻俯身躲过矛刺。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_106bdf76:

    # "The Glaive Statue drives its weapon down across your footing and locks you in place under splintered bronze and frost."
    "长戟石像将武器砸向你的脚下，碎裂的青铜和霜层锁住你，让你动弹不得。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_bf5ad9bd:

    # d "Break loose, quick!"
    d "快挣脱！"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_a4260607:

    # "Herd chops sharply at the ground with one hand, warning you to move."
    "赫德用一只手猛劈地面，警告你赶紧移动。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_ed39df82:

    # "The Glaive Statue whips its spear in a wide crescent, showering both of you with bronze splinters and driving you back for [total_enemy_damage] total HP."
    "长戟石像挥矛划出宽阔弧线，青铜碎屑如雨洒向你们，把你们逼退，造成[total_enemy_damage]点总伤害。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_e0d69828:

    # "The Bulwark slams forward with its bronze slab shield locked in place, crushing into your chest. Your health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "壁垒石像锁住青铜板盾向前冲撞，狠狠压上你的胸口。你的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_c80c75e6:

    # "The Bulwark bulldozes Daggi with a plated bronze shoulder and shield rim. [ally.name]'s health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "壁垒石像以镀铜的肩膀和盾缘推土机般撞翻达吉。[ally.name]的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_98a85cd9:

    # "The Bulwark drives its bronze weight into Herd and sends him skidding across the frost. [ally.name]'s health decreases by [enemy_damage] HP."
    "壁垒石像将青铜般的重量撞向赫德，把他撞得在霜地上滑行。[ally.name]的生命值减少[enemy_damage]点。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_d263dea2:

    # "You slide clear of the Bulwark's crushing charge before its full weight can catch you."
    "你在壁垒石像的全力冲撞追上你之前滑身避开。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_11745a2f:

    # "Daggi braces, then slips off the line of the shield bash at the last moment."
    "达吉稳住架势，最后一刻从盾击线路上闪开。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_e64ea3a4:

    # "Herd pivots around the edge of the slab shield and stays just out of reach."
    "赫德绕着板盾边缘转身，保持在它触及不到的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_b4bdf2d2:

    # "The Bulwark plants itself and beats its shield once. Stone grit shivers across both constructs as their guard tightens."
    "壁垒石像扎稳身形，重重击盾一次。两座构装体的守势收紧，石屑在它们身上簌簌颤动。"

translate schinese_rewrite crypt_bearstatue_turn_45f7d86b:

